Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:25.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.03,0:00:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错　你也听到了　贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You heard me, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,够爷们的话就放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on if you're man enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话就乖乖认命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or take it up the chain if you're a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个娘炮婊子士官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pussy-ass noncom bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不聋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的服从命令听指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it up the damn chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈给老子见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can kiss my lily-white ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么说了　你听得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said. You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后这个白痴　他挥了一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then this idiot, he takes a swing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, and well…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该欣赏下他的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you should've seen the look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他门牙都打掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I punched out his front teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,五颗门牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, five of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,乒乒乓乓　就像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pow! Pow! Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么一来害得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}16 months in the stockade…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲了16个月监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's what them teeth cost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难熬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was hard time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说实话　光是看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But by god, it was worth every minute of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混球把自己的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to see that prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐在地上　真他妈的绝对值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit his teeth out on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的　长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth every minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no! No no! No no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Godod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不　仁慈的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, merciful christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no. No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊　救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, help me! God! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊　行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, please! Jesus, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我　快救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no. Oh, no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊　上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, jesus. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no no no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人太坏　我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't behave, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活该　我活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I deserve it. I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你现在帮帮我　给我一条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me now. Show me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了　救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用在意了　你个白痴耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never you mind, silly christ boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前没求过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't begged you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也别指望我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna start begging now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不要求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna beg you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用操心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging you ever! I'll never beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不会求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前从没求过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never begged you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别放在心上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best not to dwell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔被一个人扔在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle got left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回不来没人会难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's gonna be sad he didn't come back…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧　也许除了达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except maybe Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达里尔是谁　-他弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl? - His brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有人今天过得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least somebody's having a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还给我　-住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it back. - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要　-是我找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要　-给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,米约　别和你姐姐吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mijo, leave your sister alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么　-听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的　你越烦躁就得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, the more you fidget, the longer it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动了　好吗　-我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So don't, okay? - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再尽力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样就受不了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think this is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到刮胡子时有你好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait till you start shaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可痛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day comes, you'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会无比怀念妈妈给你理发\N{\fnArial\fs30}wishing for one of your mama's haircuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真这么夸张　我才不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll believe that when I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧　如果你像个男子汉那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what… you just get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好理发\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some manly dignity and.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我教你点特别的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}tomorrow I'll teach you something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你怎么抓青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will teach you to catch frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以前抓过青蛙　-我是说一群青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've caught a frog before. - I said frogs… plural.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙　那是门艺术　抓起来可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is an art, my friend. It is not to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中的方法和工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are ways and means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道的人寥寥无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few people know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我愿意告诉你这秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to share my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是女生　你和他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm a girl. You talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此一次　不得反悔哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a one-time offer, bud… not to be repeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要这么多青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we need frogs, plural?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没吃过青蛙腿吗　-好恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever eat frog legs? - Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不　很美味　-他说得对　很恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, yum! - No, he's right. Eww.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你吃够了那些罐头豆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get down to that last can of beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会爱死青蛙腿的　女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be loving those frog legs, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就能猜到你说　肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it now… "Shane,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看能再多给我一份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I could have a second helping, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托　就一份　-是吗　走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please? Just one? - Yeah, I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听她的　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to her, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩是英雄　我们会给那帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, we'll be heroes. We'll feed these folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞到法式田鸡腿大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cajun-style kermit legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿吃猪肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather eat miss piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也好吃不到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that came out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子　数英雄人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heroes, son, spoken of in song and legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还看你我　肖恩和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, Shane and Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　你那里什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dale, can you see what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了　戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Dale!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们吗　他们回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it them? Are they back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么东西　-我猜是被盗车辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - A stolen car is my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠　把那破报警器关了　-我关不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy crap. Turn that damn thing off! - I don't know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车前盖打开　听到没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop the hood, please. Pop the damn hood,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐安德莉亚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister Andrea…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开前盖　-什么　行行　好了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pop the damn hood! - What? Okay okay. Yeah yeah yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以了　-她好吗　她没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah yeah! - Is she okay? Is she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事　她没事　-她回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's okay! She's okay! - Is she coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的　-那她怎么没和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Why isn't she with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪儿　真没事吗　-真没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? She's okay? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没事　大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine. Everybody is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了倒霉的莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Merle not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦　开辆鬼哭狼嚎的破车回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy, driving this wailing bastard up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要把那堆臭僵尸都引过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to draw every walker for miles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放心没事　-这他妈还叫没事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we're okay. - You call being stupid okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报器的声音会在山谷里回响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the alarm was echoing all over these hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本辨别不出位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to pinpoint the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是抬杠　也就说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not arguing. I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你不能长点脑子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't hurt you to think things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不会缺胳膊短腿　行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little more carefully next time, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好歹算弄了台靓车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a cool car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来见见大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come meet everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米　-安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy. - Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸　-老爸　-嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papi! - Daddy! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝　来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说了我会回来　没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'd be back, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能见到你可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a welcome sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为肯定见不到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had lost you folks for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd y'all get out of there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个新来的帮了我们　-新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New guy… he got us out. - New guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对　那疯子跑进了城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, crazy vato just got into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机大哥　来跟大家打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, helicopter boy! Come say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样　那老兄也是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy's a cop like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸　爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所适从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最能形容我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that comes closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disoriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹杂着恐惧　茫然和迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear, confusion… all those things but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但主要还是无所适从\N{\fnArial\fs30}disoriented comes closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words can be meager things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候语言是如此苍白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they fall short.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉像是被从这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like I'd been ripped out of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔离了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一度以为自己陷进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while I thought I was trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏迷中的噩梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some coma dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也醒不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}something I might not wake up from ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom said you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这么想合情合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had every reason to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况变糟糕的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When things started to get really bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,院方的人和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}they told me at the hospital that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把你们这批患者转移到亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were gonna medevac you and the other patients to Atlanta,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却没了下文\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到亚特兰大这德行我也不奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not surprised after Atlanta fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来就连医院也被行尸占领了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And from the look of that hospital, it got overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错　我好不容易才把大家救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, looks don't deceive. I barely got them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么感激你才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how grateful I am to you, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知还能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't begin to express it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言又显得苍白无力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There go those words falling short again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了　区区小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paltry things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德　能别随便添柴火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ed, you want to rethink that log?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太冷了　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再冷规矩总不能坏　你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cold don't change the rules, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,火得小些　有点就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep our fires low, just embers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以免被发现　-我说了　天气太冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we can't be seen from a distance, right? - I said it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能别多管闲事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should mind your own business for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ed…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非要和我叫板吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you sure you want to have this conversation, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧　把火熄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Pull the damn thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔　索菲亚　晚上还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carol, Sophia, how are y'all this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事　我们能行　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. We're just fine. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 火堆的事抱歉　-别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry about the fire. - No no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No apology needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all have a good night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过怎么和达里尔·迪克森说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you given any thought to Daryl Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是知道自己哥哥被抛弃肯定不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be happy to hear his brother was left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来和他说　是我弄掉的钥匙　我自己担着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him. I dropped the key. It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我铐的他　所以是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cuffed him. That makes it mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们　这没什么好争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, it's not a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想扯到种族问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to bring race into this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过说成白人做的应该好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it might sound better coming from a white guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人做事一人当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈就该离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell if I'm gonna hide from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:14:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱可以骗他　-还是实话实说的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could lie. - Or tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔那时都失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle was out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有所行动　不然他会害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something had to be done or he'd have gotten us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband did what was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔被落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Merle got left behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is nobody's fault but Merle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟达里尔这么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what we tell Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他可不会和你讲道理　你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see a rational discussion to be had from that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用我多说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word to the wise…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他弟弟打猎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have our hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就有的忙活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he gets back from his hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓坏了　所以先逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared and I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这点我承认　-我们都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not ashamed of it. - We were all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都逃了　你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all ran. What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把门用链子锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped long enough to chain that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯很窄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staircase is narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许一次可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe half a dozen geeks can squeeze against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤下六七只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}at any one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这还不足以闯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not enough to break through that…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上有链子和挂锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that chain, not that padlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:15:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的是　迪克森还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point… Dixon's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在那上面　被手铐铐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's still up there, handcuffed on that roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于找到你了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你　爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你　卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于找到你们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道能找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点得瑟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting cocky now, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有　我真的知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回过家里一趟　发现空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking into our home, finding an empty house,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们都走了　-对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- both of you gone. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相片不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photos were gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的相册都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all our family albums.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在算是得瑟了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're getting cocky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当得瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张是在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的　我真的以为再也见不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I really thought I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在医院的时候　我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were in the hospital, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to take it all back…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是我们以前争吵的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the anger and the bad times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能弥补那些过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the mistakes…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we got a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有这种机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many people get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处找都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wondered where that went.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早　-早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早　-早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早　-早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服还没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still a little damp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有太阳的话马上就干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun'll have'em dry in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的衣服也洗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You washed my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯　我们尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, best we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洗衣板上洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrubbing on a washboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如家里的旧洗衣机洗得干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't half as good as my old Maytag back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真好　谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very kind. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心的秃鹫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续啊　拆干净吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, go on, strip it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.24,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,发电机需要燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Generators need every drop of fuel they can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就发动不了车了　对不住了　格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got no power without it. Sorry, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为能再飙上几天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd get to drive it at least a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许哪天还能再偷一辆来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll get to steal another one someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得香吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sleep okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没睡这么香了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't want to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你多睡会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了　-我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. What? - I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,被落下的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the man we left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,水来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water's here, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒你们　烧开了再用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a reminder to boil before use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.11,0:22:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在问我意见还是通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you asking me or telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问你意见　-我觉得你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Asking. - Well, I think it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样实在是太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is just the stupidest way to break your…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.65,0:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈　-卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸　-宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈　妈咪　-瑞克　给\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama! Mommy! - Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔　-过来孩子们　快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl! - Over here, boy! Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔　宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.90,0:22:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈　-你没事吧　过来　过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - You're okay! I've got him. I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有被咬被抓伤　-没有　我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing bit you? Nothing scratched you? - No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,头一回在这里碰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first one we've had up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.93,0:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从没跑这么远到山上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never come this far up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.23,0:23:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里没吃的了　所以跑上山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're running out of food in the city, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我靠　-狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Jesus. - Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.56,0:24:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我打到的鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧　都让这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it. All gnawed on by this…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,脏兮兮的　染了病的\N{\fnArial\fs30}filthy, disease-bearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.17,0:24:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没娘养的杂种糟蹋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}motherless poxy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了　孩子　这没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, son. That's not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.67,0:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道个屁　老不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about it, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.34,0:24:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着你这傻逼帽子回你的“金池塘”去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this stupid hat and go back to "On Golden Pond"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子大老远追着这只鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tracking this deer for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.98,0:24:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把它带回营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna drag it back to camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给大伙上点鹿肉吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}cook us up some venison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.12,0:24:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎样　把咬掉的这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Do you think we can cut around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.12,0:24:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,割掉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}this chewed up part right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.69,0:24:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不冒那个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not risk that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈糟蹋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎了些松鼠　十来只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some squirrel… about a dozen or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.80,0:24:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.10,0:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这帮人　有没有搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, people. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.75,0:25:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命中脑袋才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们连这都不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't y'all know nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔　你他妈的给我滚出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle! Get your ugly ass out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.13,0:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎了些松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got us some squirrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.39,0:25:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来一起煮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stew 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔　等一下　我有话跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, just slow up a bit. I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.07,0:25:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.38,0:25:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在亚特兰大出了些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a… there was a problem in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.02,0:25:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.94,0:26:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是死是活你怎会不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He either is or he ain't!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.57,0:26:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No easy way to say this, so I'll just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.17,0:26:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁　-瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you?　- Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.61,0:26:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克·格兰姆斯　你有什么话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes, you got something you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.18,0:26:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥对我们造成了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother was a danger to us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.25,0:26:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把他铐在屋顶的一条金属管上\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I handcuffed him on a roof, hooked him to a piece of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.38,0:26:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着　让我好好消化一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Let me process this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.62,0:26:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你把我哥铐在屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying you handcuffed my brother to a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把他丢在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you left him there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.63,0:26:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.24,0:26:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.21,0:26:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放开我　-我看还是不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd best let me go!　- Nah, I think it's better if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.25,0:26:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁喉不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chokehold's illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.68,0:26:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去投诉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can file a complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了　伙计　我们能耗上一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. We'll keep this up all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.48,0:26:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你冷静下来谈谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to have a calm discussion on this topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:26:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we can manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.66,0:27:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we can manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那么做并不是一时兴起\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did was not on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.34,0:27:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥和其他人相处不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother does not work and play well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.07,0:27:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是瑞克的错　我拿着钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Rick's fault. I had the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.04,0:27:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结果掉了　-你不能捡起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I dropped it.　- You couldn't pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.75,0:27:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它掉进下水道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I dropped it in a drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为这能让我好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's supposed to make me feel better, it don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.36,0:27:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不如听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe this will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.93,0:27:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把屋顶的门用锁链锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I chained the door to the roof…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那些行尸抓不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the geeks couldn't get at him…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.63,0:27:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门上有挂锁　-这该有点用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With a padlock.　- It's gotta count for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.04,0:27:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都给我去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell with all y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.38,0:27:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去救他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so's I can go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.31,0:27:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.95,0:27:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.13,0:28:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.81,0:28:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备这么走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna walk off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下所有人不管吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to hell with everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下所有人不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying to hell with anybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.20,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不会丢下你和洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you Shane; Lori least of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.74,0:28:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.81,0:28:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂　瑞克　你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, okay, Rick? So could you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.95,0:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you throw me a bone here, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.05,0:28:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you just tell me why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.75,0:28:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要为莫尔·迪克森这种人渣冒这险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you risk your life for a douche bag like Merle Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.09,0:28:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说话小心点　-我很小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, choose your words more carefully.　- No, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.62,0:28:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣算客气的了　莫尔·迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douche bag's what I meant. Merle Dixon…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:29:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你渴死他也不会给你水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy wouldn't give you a glass of water if you were dying of thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这人怎么样与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he would or wouldn't do doesn't interest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.63,0:29:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会让一个人渴死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let a man die of thirst… me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.20,0:29:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么被活活晒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirst and exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.90,0:29:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他扔在那　就像掉进陷阱的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left him like an animal caught in a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.10,0:29:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不能这样死　更别说一个活生生的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no way for anything to die, let alone a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.61,0:29:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你和达里尔俩　这就是你们的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and Daryl, that's your big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得路　你之前去过那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the way. You've been there before…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.39,0:29:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,进进出出都不是问题　你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In and out, no problem. You said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.19,0:29:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair of me to ask… I know that…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但和你在一起我更有安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd feel a lot better with you along.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.66,0:29:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她也会这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she would too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.61,0:29:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好　你三个人一起去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just great. Now you're gonna risk three men, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.97,0:29:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.47,0:29:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多人　我真是受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My day just gets better and better, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看还有别人主动站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anybody else here stepping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.71,0:29:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你那混账老哥么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save your brother's cracker ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.00,0:29:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你干嘛去　-你不会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you?　- You wouldn't even begin to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不是一类人　-那就四个人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't speak my language. - That's four.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.35,0:29:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just four.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们所有人都处于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're putting every single one of us at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.82,0:29:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道　瑞克　你看到那行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just know that, Rick. Come on, you saw that walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:30:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿　就出现在营地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was here. It was in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.09,0:30:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始在城市外行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving out of the cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.59,0:30:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来了　我们需要所有有生力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come back, we need every able body we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要留在这里保护营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need 'em here. We need 'em to protect camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.33,0:30:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来　这里更需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me what you really need most here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是更多的枪　-没错　枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- are more guns.　- Right, the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.73,0:30:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等　什么枪　-六支猎枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What guns? - Six shotguns,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.67,0:30:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,两支强火力步枪　还有十来支手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}two high-powered rifles, over a dozen handguns.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.70,0:30:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走之前　我把警局里的仓库搜了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleaned out the cage back at the station before I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.27,0:30:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在亚特兰大被困住时　我把那袋子掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped the bag in Atlanta when I got swarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.01,0:30:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在大街上　我们得拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just sitting there on the street, waiting to be picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.78,0:30:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少弹药　-各式各样一共七百发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ammo?　- 700 rounds, assorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.16,0:30:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你历经艰辛找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went through hell to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.35,0:30:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又要转身离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got here and you're gonna turn around and leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸　我不想你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那些枪了　肖恩是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with the guns. Shane is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔·迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.38,0:30:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算加上那些枪　也不值得我们去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not worth one of your lives, even with guns thrown in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.04,0:30:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. Make me understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.07,0:30:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到一个男人和他的孩子　我欠他们人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe a debt to a man I met and his little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.16,0:31:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉　要不是他们收留了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, if they hadn't taken me in,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.22,0:31:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.52,0:31:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有他们　我们不可能重逢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because of them that I made it back to you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说会跟着我到亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they'd follow me to Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.42,0:31:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不提醒他　他们会重蹈我的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll walk into the same trap I did if I don't warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.06,0:31:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你联系不上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's stopping you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.53,0:31:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对讲机落在那个袋子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkie-talkie, the one in the bag I dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.43,0:31:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手里也有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.61,0:31:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来说好他们快到时再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our plan was to connect when they got closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.93,0:31:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我们的对讲机吗　-对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are our walkies? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.94,0:31:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用这个民用电台不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So use the C.B… What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.94,0:31:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,民用电台是可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}The C.B.'s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.87,0:31:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些垃圾对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the walkies that suck to crap…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.81,0:31:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是七十年代的了　不适用于其它频宽\N{\fnArial\fs30}date back to the '70s, don't match any other bandwidth…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.55,0:31:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我们车里的天线都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even the scanners in our cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那个袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.79,0:31:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.16,0:31:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.01,0:32:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你有断线钳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor is you have bolt cutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.05,0:32:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能吧　-到了屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Yeah, we get to that roof, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得弄断锁链和手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll need to cut that chain and the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.82,0:32:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向来不喜欢外借工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never like lending tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次有人借\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time I did…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对　说的就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yes, I am talking about you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.76,0:32:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧　被丢在那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just say your bag of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.13,0:32:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是你那袋枪而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't the only bag that was dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.97,0:32:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工具也被丢下了　在莫尔那\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tools got left behind with Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.08,0:32:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你的工具也带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bring your tools back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当断线钳是投资好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the bolt cutters as an investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.51,0:32:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像赌博才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like more of a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.69,0:32:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我有什么好处　-想要什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I get in return? - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.39,0:32:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你们带回来的一杆枪怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about one of those guns you bring back?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.19,0:32:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 由我挑　-成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My pick. - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.49,0:32:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　不如…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, let's…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.45,0:32:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这交易多点甜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweeten the deal a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:32:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那辆小货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that cube van of yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.33,0:33:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,车怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.74,0:33:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,房车的水箱软管被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The R.V.'s radiator hose is shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要转移或者跑远路\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a problem if we.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}need to get somewhere and wanna get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你小货车上的软管正好合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hose on that van is just about a perfect match…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之　我可以让它完全合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enough that I can make it fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.01,0:33:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧　等我们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what… we get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.45,0:33:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把那车拆成废铁我都没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can strip that van down to the bare metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.59,0:33:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点　出发吧　-谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's go! - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.82,0:33:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克　蟒蛇转轮里还有子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick, got any rounds in the Python?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.81,0:33:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次咱俩射击比赛的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time we were on the gun range,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.77,0:33:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后肯定拿了一些你的松头子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I wound up with a few loose rounds of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和那个袋子　就像个百宝箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and that bag… like the bottom of an old lady's purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做　我很不爽　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that you're doing this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.05,0:33:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢而鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that it's foolish and reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.62,0:33:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你执意要去　好歹带上子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're gonna go, you're taking bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.84,0:33:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太想在城里开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I'd want to fire a shot in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.59,0:33:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前车之鉴　-随你的便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not after what happened last time. - That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.50,0:34:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.54,0:34:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个人　四发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four men, four rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.31,0:34:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太巧了　不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.20,0:34:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能希望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just hope that…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,四是你的幸运数字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just hope four is your lucky number, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.75,0:34:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢　-不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I bet they'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.22,0:35:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯　有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.13,0:35:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.04,0:35:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么　-你想啊　妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Think about it, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.34,0:35:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经历了这么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that's happened to him so far…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.01,0:35:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还是安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing's killed him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最好没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd better be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.45,0:35:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my only word on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.20,0:35:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你了　行尸们无法接近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you the geeks can't get at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们能打开那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that's gonna get through that door is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这开始步行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walk from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.53,0:36:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.70,0:36:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到卡尔了吗　-肖恩带他去采石场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you seen Carl? - Shane took him down to the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.93,0:36:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还大言不惭地说要抓一堆青蛙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some mighty bold talk about catching frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.98,0:36:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都捉不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都狡猾地躲在水下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being all wily, staying submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮小废物肯定发现情况不妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little suckers, they know something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.96,0:36:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好用老办法解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just going to have to do this the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.66,0:36:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, little man, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.33,0:36:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the… you are the key in all this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.87,0:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是负责去追它们中的一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm gonna do is I'm gonna go after one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.97,0:36:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把其它的都吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, scare the rest of them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.57,0:36:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会四处逃窜　我把它们都往你那边赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all gonna scatter. I'm gonna drive 'em your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.64,0:36:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧　-你就负责捉住每个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - What you need to do is you need to round up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.64,0:36:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,打你眼皮底下溜过的小坏蛋　懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}every bad boy you see, all right? Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.81,0:36:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂了　-懂了就好　凶一点我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah. - Hells yeah. Give me your mean face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了长官　准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes sir. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.55,0:37:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了　-准备好了吗　开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Are you ready? Here we go, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.56,0:37:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了　小伙子　它们朝你的方向去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, little man, they're coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.49,0:37:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝你那去了　快　抓住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming your wa go on, get 'em, get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.13,0:37:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝你那去了　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming your way, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉住这些小青蛙　捉住这些小青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch them frogs. Catch them frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了来了　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming, little man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.49,0:37:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快抓　把网放那边抓住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em! Get that net in there and get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.30,0:37:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始置疑这里的劳动分工问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to question the division of labor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming, little man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.22,0:37:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快用网网住它们　快　抓住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em! Get that net in there and get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.81,0:37:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏小子　有啥收获　都抓到啥啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got, bad boy? What do you got? What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁也没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.42,0:37:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的娃　算了　咱继续努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy. All right, we've got to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.25,0:37:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油吧　先找水桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's find this bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.99,0:37:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人能解释一下为什么女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can someone explain to me how the.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.31,0:37:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得跟菲佣似的尽伺候男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}women wound up doing all the Hattie Mcdaniel work?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.36,0:37:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日到了　你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world ended. Didn't you get the memo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,世道就是如此　认了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.97,0:38:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先救莫尔还是先取枪　-先救莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merle first or guns? - Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.94,0:38:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没的商量　-我们得计划一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ain't even having this conversation. - We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.61,0:38:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里你比较熟悉　由你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the geography. It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔离这最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle's closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.25,0:38:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,取枪的话　我们得原路折回\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guns would mean doubling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.35,0:38:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,先救莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.75,0:38:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想念我的洗衣机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do miss my Maytag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.07,0:38:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念我的奔驰和卫星导航系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my Benz, my sat nav.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.17,0:38:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念我那台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my coffeemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.87,0:38:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,带有双向滴漏过滤器\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that dual-drip filter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及内置研磨器的咖啡机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and built-in grinder, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.17,0:38:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我的电脑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My computer…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And texting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念我的按摩棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my vibrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.55,0:38:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.47,0:38:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们笑什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享个人英勇事迹而已　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just swapping war stories, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.27,0:39:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.45,0:39:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin' that concerns you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心洗你的衣服　废话少说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you ought to focus on your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.99,0:39:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是什么喜剧俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't no comedy club.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.49,0:39:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.43,0:39:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过别离开戴尔的视线吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you about not leaving Dale's sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.76,0:39:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可肖恩说我们要一起抓青蛙　还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Shane said we could catch frogs, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩说什么不打紧　听我的就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what Shane says. It matters what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.40,0:39:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧　回营地去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就跟在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.78,0:39:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.65,0:39:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你不该拿他出气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think you should be taking this out on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你来告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.86,0:39:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经没这个权利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost that privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.02,0:39:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉　等一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, could you just wait up a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.22,0:39:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该谈谈　我们都没有机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should talk. We haven't had a chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.25,0:39:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了　不用谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经结束了　要谈跟青蛙谈去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's over too. You can tell that to the frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.32,0:39:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死　洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.17,0:39:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是如何看待这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know how it appears to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.26,0:39:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你是怎么想的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.25,0:40:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是如何看的　抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it appears to me? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.23,0:40:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我说的还不够清楚吗　我再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a gray area here? Let me dispel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.93,0:40:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离我远点　离我儿子远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from me. You stay away from my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看着他　别跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look at him. You don't talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.10,0:40:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始　禁止与我们一家人接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, my family is off-limits to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉　这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, I don't think that's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.04,0:40:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肖恩　闭嘴　给我闭嘴　-我认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane, shut up. Don't! - I don't think that…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.14,0:40:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老公回来了　他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is back. He is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.24,0:40:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.48,0:40:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我反而不高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm not happy about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.39,0:40:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么敢这样　你为什么做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you? Why would you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你告诉我他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one that told me that he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.76,0:40:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.02,0:41:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,操　你个恶心巴拉的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. You are one ugly skank.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.39,0:41:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德　这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, tell you what…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.23,0:41:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你不乐意我们洗你的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like how your laundry is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.76,0:41:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒是很乐意你自个儿洗　接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are welcome to pitch in and do it yourself. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.23,0:41:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女　这不是我该干的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't my job, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.93,0:41:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚　别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.97,0:41:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你干什么活　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your job, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.13,0:41:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死坐着抽烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting on your ass smoking cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比听一个自作聪明的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it sure as hell ain't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.23,0:41:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说教来的强\N{\fnArial\fs30}to some uppity smart-mouthed bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.70,0:41:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗　我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what… come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.07,0:41:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为她没必要跟着你走　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she needs to go anywhere with you, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.24,0:41:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干你屁事　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say it's none of your business. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.44,0:41:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了　-卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You heard me. - Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.48,0:42:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚　放心　没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, please. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.65,0:42:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为自己读过大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't think I won't knock you on your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.28,0:42:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会揍你　你就一逼货\N{\fnArial\fs30}just 'cause you're some college-educated cooze,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.12,0:42:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.79,0:42:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么现在跟我走　要不有你后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you come on now or you gonna regret it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.46,0:42:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然她会带着新伤出现吗　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she can show up with fresh bruises later, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.79,0:42:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀　我们亲眼见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.79,0:42:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多管闲事　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of this. Now come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.03,0:42:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗　这跟你们屁点关系也没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? This ain't none of y'all's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也不想惹怒一头公牛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to keep prodding the bull here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.10,0:42:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,话我已经说够了　赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I am done talking. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.67,0:42:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　别走　卡萝尔　你不必…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no. Carol, you don't have…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.94,0:42:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再多舌试试用　告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell me what! I tell you what!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.61,0:42:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你别以为你能怎么着　-放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think you can… - Get off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来　过来　-放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here! Come here! - Get off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.55,0:42:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开她　放开她　-放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off her! Get off her! - Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.55,0:42:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的　没事　-不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. It's okay. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.86,0:42:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的　-不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩　别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.97,0:42:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.57,0:43:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.11,0:43:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别打了　-你要是再敢对你的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - You put your hands on your wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.11,0:43:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿或者这里的任何一个人动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}your little girl or anybody else in this camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我不会就这么放过你　听到了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}one more time, I will not stop next time. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.45,0:43:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了没　-听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear me?! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.35,0:43:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会打死你　爱德　-爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll beat you to death, Ed. - Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.02,0:43:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.59,0:43:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.26,0:43:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德　对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.20,0:43:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪　爱德　都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. Ed, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.00,0:43:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.07,0:43:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德　对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起　爱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.32,0:43:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔　莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle! Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.80,0:44:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.91,0:44:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.26,0:44:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
